  "about": "CIEDE2000 on cinema.color's sRGB to Lab (D65), as backend/commons/colour.delta_e00 computes it, and the merge threshold of backend/commons/measure.py. frontend/src/lib/paletteExtract.ts ports both. deltaE00 is the backend's own value (to 1e-6). labPairs holds all 34 pairs of Sharma, Wu and Dalal (2005), numbered as in their table, with 'published' the value printed there (4 dp), so both sides are checked against the paper and not only against each other; the last two pairs take the negative and positive hue wraps away from zero chroma, with 'independent' from skimage and a from-the-paper implementation. Written by scripts/generate-colour-delta-e00-fixture.py; backend/tests/test_colour_delta_e00_contract.py and frontend/tests/colourDeltaE00Contract.test.ts fail if either side drifts.",
